==English==
{{wikipedia|dab=Specification (disambiguation)|mul=Specification (technical standard)}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|frm|en}} {{term|specification|lang=frm}}, from {{etyl|ML.|en}} ''[[specificationem]]'' (accusative of ''[[specificatio]]'')

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# An explicit set of [[requirement]]s to be satisfied by a [[material]], [[product]], or [[service]].
# An act of [[specify]]ing.

====Related terms====
* [[species]]
* [[specific]]
* [[specify]]

